flowchart TD
    A[Instron force and crosshead data] --> B[Cycle QC and adjacent-cycle train-test split]
    G[Midsole and fixture meshes] --> C[5 mm column bed: thickness, area, neighbors]
    B --> F[Shared parameter identification]
    C --> H[Hyperfoam equilibrium pressure]
    H --> M[Maxwell memory and hysteresis]
    M --> P[Pasternak lateral load spreading]
    P --> W[Column forces, net wrench, COP, work]
    W --> F
    F --> V[Held-out validation]
    F --> J[digital_shoe.json]
    J --> I[Virtual Instron]
    J --> D[80 kg free six-DOF drop]
    J --> R[Heel-to-toe rocker]

    classDef input fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0369a1,color:#0c4a6e;
    classDef physics fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,color:#78350f;
    classDef output fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d;
    class A,G,B,C input;
    class H,M,P,W,F physics;
    class V,J,I,D,R output;
